            "kind": "source_text",
            "content": "WELCOME TO SUNNYFIELD ZOO\nMeet our animals and have a happy day!\n\nOPENING HOURS\nOpen every day: 09:00 - 17:00\nLast entry: 16:00\n\nTICKETS\nAdult: £12\nChild (3-15): £8\nChildren under 3: free\n\nFEEDING TIMES\nPenguins: 11:00\nLions: 13:00\nMonkeys: 15:00\n\nPlease do not feed the animals. They have their own food.\nVisit our gift shop near the exit for toys and postcards.\nPlease keep the zoo clean. Thank you, and have fun!",
